.htm"}, {"d": "2025-11-10", "n": 6.5, "z": null, "rz": null, "q": "Having worked with Mary before, I’ve seen firsthand her ability to transform complex operations into agile, high-performing systems,", "a": "News release FOR IMMEDIATE RELEASE Avantor® Appoints Mary Blenn as Executive Vice President and Chief Operating Officer Radnor, Pa. – Novemb", "url": "https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1722482/000162828025051159/avantorappointsmaryblenn.htm"}], "now": {"d": "2026-09-21", "z": -0.06, "mood": "usual"}, "say_do": {"mood": "usual", "acts": "none", "clash": false, "agree": false}}, "score": {"value": 54, "verdict": {"it": "Nessuna convinzione chiara", "en": "No clear conviction"}, "confidence": "Media", "covered_pct": 80, "missing": ["guid"], "subs": [{"id": "insider", "name": {"it": "Insider", "en": "Insiders"}, "w": 35, "v": 50, "why": [{"it": "Nessun acquisto discrezionale negli ultimi 90 giorni.", "en": "No discretionary purchase in the last 90 days."}, {"it": "Flusso netto pesato sullo storico: +0.00 M$.", "en": "Net flow weighted by track record: +0.00 M$."}, {"it": "4 operazioni escluse perché non informative (piani 10b5-1, ritenute fiscali, esercizi e assegnazioni).", "en": "4 transactions excluded as uninformative (10b5-1 plans, tax withholding, exercises and awards)."}], "coverage": "Alta"}, {"id": "guid", "name": {"it": "Guidance e tono", "en": "Guidance and tone"}, "w": 20, "v": null, "why": [{"it": "Serve l'export delle trascrizioni delle call.", "en": "Needs the export of the earnings-call transcripts."}], "coverage": "Assente"}, {"id": "market", "name": {"it": "Mercato", "en": "Market"}, "w": 15, "v": 81, "why": [{"it": "Short interest a 26.9 milioni di azioni, -32.1% rispetto alla mediana dell'ultimo anno (39.6 milioni).", "en": "Short interest at 26.9 million shares, -32.1% against the median of the last year (39.6 million)."}, {"it": "Sono il 3.97% delle azioni in circolazione (678 milioni, fonte SEC).", "en": "That is 3.97% of shares outstand